      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation ring: chain 84. Sl st to the first ch to form a ring, placing the stitch marker at the join."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 3 (counts as tr). Work 2 tr into the first ch. *Skip 2 ch, dc into the next ch, skip 2 ch, work 5 tr into the next ch*. Repeat around, ending with 2 tr into the foundation ch-3 space. Join with sl st."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 1. Dc into the join. *Skip 2 tr, work 5 tr into the next dc, skip 2 tr, dc into the centre tr of the next shell*. Repeat around. Join with sl st to first dc."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Round 2 until the cowl measures 26 cm from the foundation ring."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Picot round"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "*Sl st into the next st, ch 3, sl st into the same st*. Repeat all the way round. Fasten off. Weave in all ends. Wet block to the finished dimensions."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
